<title>SINGAPORE: Thai Bangchak refinery cuts runs amid low margins.</title>
<headline>Thai Bangchak refinery cuts runs amid low margins.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai refiner Bangchak Petroleum Plc earlier on Wednesday cut the operating rate of its 120,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) by 20,000 bpd, a company source said.</p>
<p>&quot;We try to run the crude unit at maximum but sometimes its not possible because of the economics,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>The company was expected to raise the operating rate back to 120,000 bpd sometime next week, he said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3093)</p>
